"82M114 : Input Processing"

PC21.31.21 FUNCM 

PC21.31.21.1 MOVE (B,1)
          :1                  =82M114.ON:SELECTED
          :21                 =82M114.ON:MAN

PC21.31.21.2 AND (4)
