          :H1                 D=1.200000E+00
          :I<H1 
          :I>=H1 
          :LHYS               D=2.000000E-01
          :L1                 D=5.000000E+00
          :I>L1 
          :I<=L1 

PC21.31.22.1.109 OR-A (1,2,0,0,0,0)
          :1                  1
